医学术语数据集 · 来源许可

ICD10CM_2027 — CDC/NCHS，ICD-10-CM FY2027。美国政府发布代码表。
https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/icd/icd-10-cm/files.html
ICD10PCS_2027 — CMS，ICD-10-PCS FY2027。美国政府发布代码表。
https://www.cms.gov/medicare/coding-billing/icd-10-codes

DOID — Human Disease Ontology，2026-09-30。CC0 1.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/doid.html
SYMP — Symptom Ontology，2026-07-30。CC0 1.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/symp.html
UBERON — Uberon contributors，2026-10-01。CC BY 3.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/uberon.html
PATO — Phenotype And Trait Ontology，2026-10-01。CC BY 3.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/pato.html
MMO — Measurement Method Ontology，2026-10-10。CC0 1.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/mmo.html
UO — Units of Measurement Ontology，2026-10-12。CC BY 4.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/uo.html
CTO — Core Ontology of Clinical Trials。CC BY 4.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/cto.html
STATO — The Statistical Methods Ontology，2026-04-20。CC BY 3.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/stato.html
ONS — Ontology for Nutritional Studies，2026-02-06。CC BY 4.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/ons.html
MAXO — Medical Action Ontology，2026-01-15。CC BY 4.0。
https://obofoundry.org/ontology/maxo.html

RXNORM_PRESCRIBE — U.S. National Library of Medicine，RxNorm Current Prescribable Content，2026-10-05。NLM 标准化通用成分名及 RXCUI，公有领域。
https://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm/docs/termsofservice.html
FDA_DEVICE — U.S. Food and Drug Administration，Product Classification Database。公有领域及 CC0 1.0。
https://open.fda.gov/data/product-classification/
NCIT_FULL — U.S. National Cancer Institute Enterprise Vocabulary Services，NCI Thesaurus™ 26.09d 影像术语节选。CC BY 4.0。
https://evs.nci.nih.gov/ftp1/NCI_Thesaurus/ThesaurusTermsofUse.pdf
MESH_DESC — U.S. National Library of Medicine，Medical Subject Headings 2026 英文主题词与编码节选。NLM MeSH 使用条款。
https://www.nlm.nih.gov/databases/download/terms_and_conditions_mesh.html

